				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Hush</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1701286</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Why is this a -J? It's a skip <em>about</em> bad TV comedy, in the same way that <strong>Laugh Is Fun</strong> is, but neither are actually comedic.</p> <p>As it stands, this is an uncontained anomaly that's infected the Foundation itself, so Keter and a major threat. Why isn't the Foundation trying to identify and contain/neutralise it - or at least find the infection vector and method of transmission?</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
